### 1. permitAll: без логіну -> 200
GET http://localhost:8080/hello/public

### 2. permitAll: головна сторінка без логіну -> 200
GET http://localhost:8080/

### 3. admin -> /hello/admin -> 200
GET http://localhost:8080/hello/admin
Authorization: Basic admin admin

### 4. admin -> /hello/user -> 403
GET http://localhost:8080/hello/user
Authorization: Basic admin admin

### 5. user -> /hello/user -> 200
GET http://localhost:8080/hello/user
Authorization: Basic user user

### 6. user -> /hello/admin -> 403
GET http://localhost:8080/hello/admin
Authorization: Basic user user

### 7. superadmin -> /hello/superadmin -> 200
GET http://localhost:8080/hello/superadmin
Authorization: Basic superadmin superadmin

### 8. admin -> /hello/superadmin -> 403
GET http://localhost:8080/hello/superadmin
Authorization: Basic admin admin

### 9. hasAnyRole: admin -> /hello/man -> 200
GET http://localhost:8080/hello/man
Authorization: Basic admin admin

### 10. hasAnyRole: user -> /hello/man -> 200
GET http://localhost:8080/hello/man
Authorization: Basic user user

### 11. hasAnyRole: superadmin -> /hello/man -> 403
GET http://localhost:8080/hello/man
Authorization: Basic superadmin superadmin

### 12. hasAnyRole: superadmin -> /hello/staff -> 200
GET http://localhost:8080/hello/staff
Authorization: Basic superadmin superadmin

### 13. без анотації: user -> /hello/all -> 200
GET http://localhost:8080/hello/all
Authorization: Basic user user

### 14. без анотації: superadmin -> /hello/all -> 200
GET http://localhost:8080/hello/all
Authorization: Basic superadmin superadmin

### 15. неправильний пароль -> 401
GET http://localhost:8080/hello/admin
Authorization: Basic admin wrong

### 16. без авторизації на захищений роут -> 401
GET http://localhost:8080/hello/user